{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22275","headline":"郡亭 · 白居易","name":"郡亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平旦起视事，亭午卧掩关。\n除亲簿领外，多在琴书前。\n况有虚白亭，坐见海门山。\n潮来一凭槛，宾至一开筵。\n终朝对云水，有时听管弦。\n持此聊过日，非忙亦非闲。\n山林太寂莫，朝阙空喧烦。\n唯兹郡合内，嚣静得中间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}